{"id": "unknown-2026-07-27-030", "date": "2026-07-27", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 31, "weekday": "Mon"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Lebanon tenders 350 MW of solar", "content": "<p>A tender is open in Lebanon covering five grid-connected solar projects with a combined capacity of 350 MW, to be paired with up to 1 GWh of battery storage. The deadline to submit expressions of interest is August 31.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/27/lebanon-tenders-350-mw-of-solar/\">Lebanon tenders 350 MW of solar</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com\">pv magazine Global</a>.</p>\n", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/07/27/lebanon-tenders-350-mw-of-solar/", "type": "rss"}]}
